Capacity [SimTalk] - Conveyor
Sets the Capacity, i.e., the number of MUs or MU parts that may be located on the Conveyor designated by
<Path> as a whole or in part at any one time.
Remarks
When this number is reached, the Conveyor does not accept any further MUs, even if its full length is not
exhausted.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Capacity:integer
Watchable
The attribute is watchable.
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Specify -1 for an infinite capacity.
Example
if MyConveyor.Capacity = -1 
   @.move(AEstreet)
end
See also
Capacity [text box] - Conveyor
NumMUParts [SimTalk] - material flow objects
Capacity [SimTalk] - Conveyor
