CurrentSpeed [SimTalk] - Conveyor
Sets the Current Speed of the Conveyor designated by <Path> in the forward direction (positive number)
or in reverse (negative number).
Remarks
Specify any real number.
You can only set the Current Speed after you activate Acceleration/AccelerationEnabled.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.CurrentSpeed:speed
Watchable
The attribute is watchable for special values.
By watching this value, you might, for example, detect the event when the Conveyor has reached its Final
Speed.
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type speed.
Return Value
Is inf if you specify -1 for an infinite speed.
Example
MyConveyor.CurrentSpeed := 2
