Speed [SimTalk] - Conveyor
Sets the Speed with which the Conveyor designated by <Path> transports the MUs.
Remarks
Speed and Length form the Processing Time on the object.
The Processing Time is the Length divided by the Speed. You can also enter -1 for an infinite speed.
Note
When you change the Speed Plant Simulation re-computes all events relating to the Speed for all MUs
located on the object. If the MU located at the exit of the object is neither blocked nor stopped, it may
happen that a new Out event is scheduled. In this case the Exit Control is called again independent of
the attribute ExitControlOnce.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.SpeedCtrl:speed
Watchable
The attribute is watchable.
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type speed.
Example
MyConveyor.Speed := 0.5 // meters per second
SimTalk
