SpeedCtrl [SimTalk] - Conveyor
Designates a Method object of the object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The Conveyor/loading space of type Line of the Transporter designated by <Path> call the Method as soon
as they reach their final speed after accelerating or decelerating or when they stop after decelerating.
The Speed Control is not called if the speed changes without using up any time at all.
If you did not enter a Method, the attribute is VOID.
You can only set the Speed Control after you activate Acceleration/AccelerationEnabled.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.SpeedCtrl:method
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type method.
Example
MyConveyor.SpeedCtrl := &mySpeedControl
SimTalk
